1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Omega: When you get near the top of your range your shoulders come up.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Your jaw locks and the sound has nowhere to go except back down your throat.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Watch me do it wrong on purpose.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Now watch the same note with space.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Same note, same body, the only difference is I gave it a room to live in.

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Raise your eyebrows, not for expression but for architecture.

7
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:42,000
The soft palate lifts when the eyebrows lift, and that is the ceiling of the room.

8
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Take the breath low and do not pull the shoulders up with it.

9
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Lip buzz through the phrase first so the sound stays forward.

10
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:00,000
You will feel it move into the front of your face where it belongs.

11
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:06,000
That is where it lives.

12
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Your voice is not the thing you use to be heard, it is the thing you are.

